(1) N-Q step 1: two-projection lemma
  A(A-1)(A-2) with P^2=P,Q^2=Q  = -P*Q + P*Q*P - Q*P + Q*P*Q
  so spec(P+Q) in {0,1,2}  =>  PQP+QPQ = PQ+QP  =>  (PQP)^2=PQP  =>  |QP-PQP|^2=PQP-(PQP)^2=0  =>  QP=PQP=PQ
  random n=4,k=2: ||[P,Q]||=0.920, max dist(spec(P+Q),Z)=0.438
  random n=6,k=3: ||[P,Q]||=0.855, max dist(spec(P+Q),Z)=0.273
  random n=8,k=3: ||[P,Q]||=0.882, max dist(spec(P+Q),Z)=0.264
  counterexample (drop N5): A=2P, B=2Q, theta=pi/3: spec A = [0. 2.]  spec B = [-0.  2.]  spec(A+B) = [1. 3.]  ||[A,B]|| = 2.44949
